  "narrative": {
    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** Beta field development advanced with a high-return C04 well, while a mechanical failure on the C32 well forced abandonment. Royalty relief was secured, boosting Beta’s long-term economics. Despite consecutive earnings misses, the stock rose on these updates, highlighting a market focus on operational catalysts and supportive oil prices.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Management reaffirmed guidance, demonstrating confidence despite the C32 setback. The move to quickly re-spud and the royalty relief success show proactive capital allocation. The market’s positive reaction to the operational news, ignoring the earnings shortfalls, suggests management’s development plan retains credibility.",
