        "snippet": "Amplify Energy (NYSE:AMPY) Announces Quarterly Earnings Results - BBNS\n\n# Amplify Energy (NYSE:AMPY) Announces Quarterly Earnings Results\n\nPosted by Grant Hamersma on May 12th, 2026\n\nShare on Twitter Share on Facebook Share on LinkedIn Share on Stocktwits\n\nAmplify Energy (NYSE:AMPY– Get Free Report) posted its quarterly earnings results on Monday. The company reported ($0.93) earnings per share for the quarter, missing analysts’ consensus estimates of $0.06 by ($0.99), FiscalAI reports. Amplify Energy had a net margin of 16.69% and a negative return on equity of 4.10%. The company had revenue of $37.46 million during the quarter, compared to analyst estimates of $38.11 million.\n\n## Amplify Energy Trading Up 3.9%\n\nAMPY opened at $5.50 on Tuesday. The company’s 50 day moving average is $5.98 and its 200-day moving average is $5.36. Amplify Energy has a 1-year low of $2.60 and a 1-year high of $6.79. The company has a market cap of $226.93 million, a P/E ratio of 5.61 and a beta of -0.13.",
